        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>Pest control lead generation works best when campaigns match the pest problem, service area and customer&#x27;s next step. A termite inspection, rodent treatment and recurring maintenance plan should not all follow the same inquiry process.</p>
